<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/datasets/haxby2001> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The block-design fMRI study behind Haxby et al. 2001, prepared and published as a dataset anyone could download and rerun. It is the data PyMVPA's tutorials are built on, and it went on to be reanalysed far more often than a single study's data usually is -- an early demonstration that sharing a dataset outlives the paper it was collected for." .
