<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/mri-phantoms-afterlife> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Scanner QA data is acquired to watch the scanner, and then it is filed away. This asks what else it is good for -- whether the variance in routine phantom scans explains variance in the human data acquired around them, which would make years of accumulated QA scans a covariate rather than a formality." .
