_:r11e865d9d165ceb99e995ab5_nba71aa8992b94647af485002fb628879b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A multimodal cell census and atlas of the mammalian primary motor cortex" .
_:r11e865d9d165ceb99e995ab5_nba71aa8992b94647af485002fb628879b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> .
