_:r1e215d7ee707f0d5dcc5c117_n04b254ef5d4a45e29db49ff894ca9f9cb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Independent collaborator at the Center for Open Neuroscience. Core Debian distribution contributor (debhelper, debian-installer, debconf, pristine-tar). Developer of git-annex used in DataLad." .
