_:r47a864d225eaa4ecf15276be_n1211e3062c6a433f813768cbf0cbd778b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
