_:r9f052cb6a26dbe7284d6b2e0_n36b9ff40b1af4b56bc24f618f0f83c06b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Research Professor of Psychological and Brain Sciences and Adjunct Professor of Computer Science at Dartmouth, official Debian Developer, contributor to <a href=\"https://www.openhub.net/accounts/yarikoptic\">many</a> open source projects -- Yaroslav (AKA Yarik) is a lead of <a href=\"/projects#dandi_\">DANDI</a>, <a href=\"/projects#datalad_\">DataLad</a>, <a href=\"/projects#pymvpa_\">PyMVPA</a>, <a href=\"/projects#neurodebian_\">NeuroDebian</a>, and other <a href=\"/projects\">projects</a>. He is also currently serving on BIDS standard Steering and <a href=\"/projects#neurodata_without_borders__neurophysiology_nwb_n_\">NWB</a> standard technical advisory committees, and engaged in various other initiatives, projects, and efforts." .
