_:rc658d771ddb2cfeccecfc7f7_n26d4f2e243d842e992486870f9ec724fb10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/section> .
