_:rcb22ac7865255391ba1a6419_nae3ec5ebb6064d5bb0d66b8c192987afb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/con/tinuous\">con/tinuous</a> is a command for downloading build logs and (for GitHub only) artifacts and release assets for a GitHub repository from GitHub Actions, Travis-CI.com, and/or Appveyor. By downloading them all, and optionally placing them under <a href=\"#datalad\">DataLad</a> control you can establish the backup, distribution, and convenient harmonious access to all those artifacts. </p>" .
