_:rd5783ea9f8c3dce62070c919_ne723571db3ac4409bd012fdcd72acd69b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
